Package: clevo-cc-linux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, polkitd | policykit-1, clevo-cc-linux-dkms
Recommends: acpi-call-dkms
Description: Clevo control center (fan and performance mode)
 Privileged daemon and CLI for reading fan speed and controlling the fan and
 performance modes of Clevo DCHU ACPI laptops, using the reverse-engineered
 _DSM protocol. Reads are open to local users; writes are authorized through
 PolicyKit. The kernel driver is provided by clevo-cc-linux-dkms.

Package: clevo-cc-linux-dkms
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: clevo-cc ACPI platform driver (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree kernel driver binding ACPI\CLV0001 that exposes Clevo fan
 monitoring and fan-mode control through hwmon and sysfs. Built for each
 installed kernel through DKMS.

Package: clevo-cc-linux-ui
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, clevo-cc-linux
Description: Graphical control center for Clevo
 Tauri (GTK/WebKitGTK) desktop application for the clevo-cc-linux daemon.
